Clipboard Indicator project-selected GNOME 51 port
-------------------------------------------------
UUID: clipboard-indicator@tudmotu.com
Source: Tudmotu/gnome-shell-extension-clipboard-indicator commit
39a0f9077daca21a62adaa975eb6a03bda499f27, archive clipboard-indicator.tar.gz.
This is the selected open upstream pull request 641, not an upstream release:
https://github.com/Tudmotu/gnome-shell-extension-clipboard-indicator/pull/641
License: MIT, LICENSE.rst, copyright 2014 Yotam Bar-On.
The source replaces removed GNOME APIs while retaining GNOME 50 compatibility.
The actual README.md is retained; the upstream Makefile names a nonexistent
README.rst. Only its runtime modules, stylesheet, metadata, license, README,
schema XML and compiled translations are packaged. Existing .mo files are
rebuilt from the pinned .po inputs. No Makefile target is executed.

