Legacy migration identity
-------------------------
The version-tag 72860 no-screenshot-box-old.zip archive has no bundled license
and is used only to identify the previous user-local payload, never installed
as the new licensed payload. legacy-no-screenshot-box.sha256 binds its five
regular source files plus a schema cache independently compiled from its XML.
The installed copy was compared with those archive bytes and the generated
cache; no host settings were used to derive acceptance or the identity.

Acceptance boundary
-------------------
Archive, source, metadata, compilation and file-closure checks are separate from
functional GNOME session acceptance. Clipboard's selected PR and the No
Screenshot Box metadata port require real runtime checks. Preparation alone
establishes neither extension behavior nor successful package publication or
installed-system updates.
